{"id":"64dcd3af45913808","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-effective-borel-code.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive3 Effective Borel Code","display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-effective-borel-code — ZFC Descriptive3 Effective Borel Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-effective-borel-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive3-effective-borel-code"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-effective-borel-code — ZFC Descriptive3 Effective Borel Code","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursive-well-founded-tree-code.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-effective-borel-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-effective-borel-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive3-effective-borel-code — ZFC Descriptive3 Effective Borel Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"636795b93c46e3ba\" href=\"?note=636795b93c46e3ba\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursive-well-founded-tree-code.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursive-well-founded-tree-code.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"37437e63af9f668e\" href=\"?note=37437e63af9f668e\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in V\">\\(c\\in V\\)</span> (code candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:\\omega\\to\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\nu:\\omega\\to\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (a fixed primitive-recursive bijection, with inverse <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu^{-1}\">\\(\\nu^{-1}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle-,-\\rangle:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\">\\(\\langle-,-\\rangle:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\)</span> (a fixed primitive-recursive pairing)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWellFoundedTreeCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWellFoundedTreeCode}_S\\)</span> (recursive well-founded-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"636795b93c46e3ba\" href=\"?note=636795b93c46e3ba\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursive-well-founded-tree-code.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursive-well-founded-tree-code.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S\\)</span> (total recursive function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"37437e63af9f668e\" href=\"?note=37437e63af9f668e\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-coded function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3EffectiveBorelCode}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3EffectiveBorelCode}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}effective\\text{-}borel\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3EffectiveBorelCode}_S(c)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(c)\n\\land\\exists T,\\ell\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nT=\\{s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}:c(\\langle0,\\nu^{-1}(s)\\rangle)=1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWellFoundedTreeCode}_S(T)\n\\land\\varnothing\\in T\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,T,\\omega)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\ell(s)=c(\\langle1,\\nu^{-1}(s)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\neg\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle m\\rangle\\in T)\\bigr)\n\\leftrightarrow \\ell(s)\\geq2\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\ell(s)=0\\to\\exists!m\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle m\\rangle\\in T)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\ell(s)=1\\to\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle m\\rangle\\in T)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}effective\\text{-}borel\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3EffectiveBorelCode}_S(c)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(c)\n\\land\\exists T,\\ell\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nT=\\{s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}:c(\\langle0,\\nu^{-1}(s)\\rangle)=1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWellFoundedTreeCode}_S(T)\n\\land\\varnothing\\in T\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,T,\\omega)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\ell(s)=c(\\langle1,\\nu^{-1}(s)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\neg\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle m\\rangle\\in T)\\bigr)\n\\leftrightarrow \\ell(s)\\geq2\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\ell(s)=0\\to\\exists!m\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle m\\rangle\\in T)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\ell(s)=1\\to\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle m\\rangle\\in T)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A leaf label <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(s)=2+k\">\\(\\ell(s)=2+k\\)</span> denotes the Baire basic open set determined by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(k)\">\\(\\nu(k)\\)</span>; label <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> is unary complementation and label <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> is countable union over the immediate successors.</li>\n<li>Both tree membership and the label map are uniformly decoded from the one total recursive function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>; well-foundedness makes recursive evaluation of the represented Borel set legitimate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursive-well-founded-tree-code.md","status":"resolved","id":"636795b93c46e3ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursive-well-founded-tree-code.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"37437e63af9f668e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursive-well-founded-tree-code.md","status":"resolved","id":"636795b93c46e3ba","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWellFoundedTreeCode}_S$ (recursive well-founded-tree predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursive-well-founded-tree-code.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"37437e63af9f668e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S$ (total recursive function predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-coded function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu:\\omega\\to\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle-,-\\rangle:\\omega^2\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWellFoundedTreeCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3EffectiveBorelCode}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}effective\\text{-}borel\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3EffectiveBorelCode}_S(c)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(c)\n\\land\\exists T,\\ell\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nT=\\{s\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}:c(\\langle0,\\nu^{-1}(s)\\rangle)=1\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveWellFoundedTreeCode}_S(T)\n\\land\\varnothing\\in T\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,T,\\omega)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\ell(s)=c(\\langle1,\\nu^{-1}(s)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\neg\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle m\\rangle\\in T)\\bigr)\n\\leftrightarrow \\ell(s)\\geq2\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\ell(s)=0\\to\\exists!m\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle m\\rangle\\in T)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\ell(s)=1\\to\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle m\\rangle\\in T)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\ell(s)=2+k","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(k)","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false}],"bytes":2581,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1826","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-effective-borel-code.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive3-effective-borel-code]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","636795b93c46e3ba","37437e63af9f668e","36d7463d215be751"]}